description:
from women's health magazine, these taste awesome and they're really healthy for you! i like to put them in the fridge and microwave one for breakfast. here's women's health mag description: 

you may still be sporting sandals, but cold and flu season will be back faster than you can say "gesundheit!" protect yourself with this spicy triple threat. car­rots are rich in immune-boosting vitamin a, zinc-packed pumpkin seeds ward off infection, and apple juice flows with sniffle-stifling vitamin c. "if your body needs to protect itself or heal, these three vitamins are essential," zeratsky says.

another weapon: yogurt. studies show that its good-for-you bacteria provide another line of defense against microbes.
